    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d24">

                <pb facs="0084" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg14"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 182/5</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Dr. S. E. Mezes to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-09">November 9,
                            1917</date>.<lb/>[Received November 10.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I expect to spend next
                    Monday and Tuesday, and if necessary, Wednesday and Thursday, in Washington,
                    staying with Mr. Baruch at 1520–18th Street, telephone, North 8959. I shall get
                    into touch with you regarding the matters mentioned in your favor of November
                    5th.</p>
                <pb facs="0085" n="15" xml:id="pg15"/>
                <p>I am enclosing a second draft giving an outline of the subjects to be dealt with
                    in The Inquiry that seem to be most urgent.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">S. E. Mezes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d24-a1.xml" xpointer="d24-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
